flowchart TD
    Start([Dashboard -> Produk]) --> Action{Pilih tindakan}

    Action -->|Tambah| AddForm[Tambah: isi SKU, nama, harga, stok]
    AddForm --> ValidCheck{Validasi input & SKU}
    ValidCheck -->|Tidak| AddForm
    ValidCheck -->|Ya| SaveAdd[Simpan produk + stok awal + mutasi]
    SaveAdd --> List([Daftar produk terbarui])

    Action -->|Edit| EditForm[Edit produk & simpan perubahan]
    EditForm --> List

    Action -->|Hapus| HistCheck{Ada histori transaksi/stok?}
    HistCheck -->|Ya| SoftDel[Arsip/soft delete]
    HistCheck -->|Tidak| HardDel[Hapus permanen jika aman]
    SoftDel --> List
    HardDel --> List

